; A minimal relation-bearing program that does saturate.
;
; Two rules over a small datatype, with a relation declared outside it and used in a rule
; head. The repeated seeds make the same two-rule combination recur, so the reuse layer forms
; Uses and the ripen queue has something to saturate: this produced 6 shared states where the
; larger egg math demo produces none.
;
; Kept small so the whole pipeline finishes in seconds.
(datatype Expr (Num i64) (Add Expr Expr) (Seed i64))
(relation Marked (Expr))
(rule ((= s (Seed n))) ((Add (Num n) (Num n))))
(rule ((= e (Add a b))) ((Marked e)))
(Seed 1)
(Seed 2)
(Seed 3)
(Seed 4)
(Seed 5)
(Seed 6)
(Seed 7)
(Seed 8)
(run 3)
